  <item>
    <title>EP08.我的《牛马日记》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6734131643dc3a438732331a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6734131643dc3a438732331a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Nov 2024 02:50:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhqlHPAN-HEmdXwn0mkibJtK4zku.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>职场系列第二弹！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>今期荷兰郊野小组成员们从第一份工作说起，聊聊我们是如何沦落到这般田地，成为社会牛马/吗喽的！在吐槽老板做过zui过分的事的同时，也探讨一下我们眼中80后和00后牛马的不同模样～</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>当然不少得分享一些摸鱼心得，希望你听完又拥有了新一天当牛马的动力，撸起袖子，干！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🕰️</span><strong><span>Timeline】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a>你是牛马还是吗喽？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a>初为牛马，我们的第一份工干了啥？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">07:02</a>职场新人，不懂也不敢问</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a>用老板的电脑看《午夜凶铃》！？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="838">13:58</a>很多牛马选择的第一个职场——广告公司</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a>第一份工打足7年——因为热爱</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a> 当下应届生和80后应届生之大不同</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1145">19:05</a>谁给你贴上牛马的标签？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a>你的第一份工作对你的影响？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a>想扁平化？办公室内全部都叫英文名吧！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a>小公司的缺点之老板一言堂</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1531">25:31</a>大公司的缺点之走走走走走流程</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a>规范化的工作流程之必要</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">28:50</a>初为牛马，先学与人相处</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1798">29:58</a>在职场发现新世界</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a>经费不足，牛马变model</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2055">34:15</a>不动脑筋又想摸鱼！？发梦！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a>觉得工作没有挑战性？那就挑战上司的忍耐力吧</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a>整顿职场？其实会不会最后只是整顿了自己？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2534">42:14</a>老板最过分的要求：帮他剪鼻毛</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a>当凌晨一点，上司和你对稿件</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a>老板整天在办公室里面干什么？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3130">52:10</a>老板公然摸鱼——投屏与女友聊天</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3270">54:30</a>正确摸鱼，从我做起</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3765">1:02:45</a>摸鱼是一件很私人的事（勿扰）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>💡</span><strong><span>Highlight】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1、摸鱼不是问题，但今天的工作不完成还摸鱼就是问题。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2、小红书非世界。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎵</span><strong><span>本期歌单】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>山下达郎《街物语》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>📣</span><strong><span>音频平台】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小宇宙《荷兰郊野》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>APPLE PODCAST《荷兰郊野》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>喜马拉雅《荷兰郊野》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>📮</span><strong><span>投稿合作】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>hollandsofunny@163.com</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p>]]></description>
