  <item>
    <title>EP07.还钱啊！老友！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671737ab0d2f24f289ea1f42</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671737ab0d2f24f289ea1f42</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Oct 2024 05:27:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>所谓有借有还，再借不难。今时今日，大家都捂着钱包过日子，如果这时候有人问你借钱，你会做这个好人吗？今期cat和Ca姐一起聊聊那些年追数的辛酸经历～</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🕰️</span><strong><span>Timeline】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a>我是怎么把钱借出去的？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a>借钱难？追数更难！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a>借钱套路之第一次借了马上还然后再借之后就找不到人了</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a>追数有方法之—第一步：写欠条！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a>起诉？微信就可以！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a>不好意思追数的心态</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a>这些由借钱诱发的故事，你是否也很熟悉？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a>伴侣有否欠债，怎么查？（求支招）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a>结婚前，不妨先看看征信报告</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a>追数有方法之—要不要报J？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a>这样的奇葩还钱方式，你是否也很熟悉？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2345">39:05</a>谨慎！这些情况之下，特别容易把钱借出去！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a>怎样的借钱思维，可以令自己好过一点点？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2730">45:30</a>追数追到变成征信科普大使</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2830">47:10</a>稍稍八卦一下他国人民失信的后果</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>💡</span><strong><span>Highlight】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1、 抱着没有了这个朋友的心态，然后把钱借出去</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎵</span><strong><span>本期歌单】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>古巨基《钱钱钱钱》</span></p><span></span><p><span>Pink Floyd《Money》</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>📣</span><strong><span>音频平台】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小宇宙《荷兰郊野》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>APPLE PODCAST《荷兰郊野》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>喜马拉雅《荷兰郊野》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>📮</span><strong><span>投稿合作】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>hollandsofunny@163.com</span></strong></p>]]></description>
