  <item>
    <title>EP06.赏花赏月赏秋乡</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e15542ee04007d88c790b0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e15542ee04007d88c790b0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Sep 2024 08:30:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>电影中那句经典的台词“赏花赏月赏秋香”，对于现实中的我们来说，应该是赏“花赏月赏秋乡”，故乡的乡。</span></p><span></span><p><span>中秋刚好也是我们几个最喜爱的传统节日。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今期我们畅谈与萍水相逢的人以小龙虾共渡中秋的难忘经历；总是缺席赏月坐席的爸爸；还有每年都会增加成员的中秋节大合照。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然少不了来个中秋食物红黑榜，也想知道你吃田螺，是用咀啜还是用牙签吃？</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于中秋的回忆与想法，尽情留言给我们吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【🕰️Timeline】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a>中秋节是一年里最喜欢的传统节日</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a>中秋节的布置与氛围感总会特别温馨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">07:05</a>中秋的必备美食：粥&amp;炒田螺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a>中秋就是晚餐刚吃完马上再来一顿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a>一些庆祝中秋的建议：深中通道看月光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a>分享各自难忘的中秋回忆：病院里的小龙虾、一束花，以及白兔灯笼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a>中山人过中秋就会联想到白水井的灯笼店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a>你今年买什么灯笼？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a>中秋节的仪式感：赏月、中秋晚会、合照、乡村卡拉OK</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a>中秋节必看的影视作品？《溏心风暴》？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a>Jill推荐《新难兄难弟》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2413">40:13</a>Cat推荐《小偷家族》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a>Antie K推荐《火星救援》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2934">48:54</a>最爱的中秋食物？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3028">50:28</a>五仁月饼我撑你！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3190">53:10</a>月饼不用切，拿着一整个吃吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3236">53:56</a>节日吃不完的月饼，可以这样处理～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">56:30</a>栗子、芋头、菱角，你们家都会准备吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3470">57:50</a>最讨厌的中秋食物？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3660">61:00</a>田螺，用咀啜还是用牙签吃？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【💡Highlight】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1、藉着节日的契机，人总是会最大化地释放自己的善意。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、人是群体动物。</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、中国人并不是要将所有节日都变成情人节，而是希望所有节日都能热热闹闹，哪怕是清明。</span></p><span></span><p><span>4、不会发声的灯笼是最漂亮的！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>5、人会慢慢不自觉地活成了自己父母的样子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>6、不要去改变父母，而是改变自己对待这样的他/她的方式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>7、“看不到烟花，听烟花也好呀！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【🎵本期歌单】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>宇多田光《fly me to the moon》</span></p><span></span><p><span>梁家辉《Tell Laura I Love Her》</span></p><span></span><p><span>金志文《月亮不走我得走》</span></p><span></span><p><span>魏如昀《秋乡》</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【📣音频平台】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙《荷兰郊野》</span></p><span></span><p><span>APPLE PODCAST《荷兰郊野》</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜马拉雅《荷兰郊野》</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【📮投稿合作】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>hollandsofunny@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lua5QjrlZta2yOd2obH0JtGxXqY3.m4a" length="134699085" type="audio/mp4"/>
