  <item>
    <title>EP05.回忆里的暑假</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bc69ea33591c27be064606</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bc69ea33591c27be064606</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Aug 2024 08:25:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>暑假，是成年前还能让你挥霍的时光。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>百无聊赖的时间，孩子难免会发挥自己的想象力和“童真”，做出一些匪夷所思的疯狂事，激发家长们发掘衣架、衣叉、甚至是胶花等等家庭用品的另一种重要用途（你懂的）。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎一起回忆发生在暑假的趣事，评论区见！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🕰️</span><strong><span>Timeline】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a>踩单车上高速！？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a>千禧年代的交谊舞风潮@中山</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a>暑假令家长疯狂之ding个仔落河</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="521">08:41</a>九曲河以前真系有条河</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a>兄弟姐妹表弟表妹齐聚的时间</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="775">12:55</a>热辣辣夏令营</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a>临暑假结束先嚟赶作业</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a>表姐也疯狂之将我变成谢霆锋（bushi）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a>开学前，一定要剪个丑丑的发型</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a>看电视自学成才——抛汽水樽</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a>心大的父母，也需要自己放暑假</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a>必看！儿歌金曲颁奖典礼</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2465">41:05</a>凌晨追深夜卡通片</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2510">41:50</a>台风天，落街撑艇</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2750">45:50</a>暑假翻煲的影视剧</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2889">48:09</a>了结少年心事——暑假表白</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3130">52:10</a>不如打下暑假工</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">62:00</a>痴痴呆呆睇点歌台</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3890">64:50</a>唔被阿爸阿妈打一身点算过暑假？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎵</span><strong><span>本期歌单】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>戴恩玲《爱心一百次》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>许思行《月亮下祷告》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>📣</span><strong><span>音频平台】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小宇宙《荷兰郊野》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>APPLE PODCAST《荷兰郊野》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>喜马拉雅《荷兰郊野》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>📮</span><strong><span>投稿合作】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>hollandsofunny@163.com</span></strong></p>]]></description>
