  <item>
    <title>EP04.那些年，我们在职场共事过的懵炳1.0</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66963f5a37236c546e875d5e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66963f5a37236c546e875d5e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jul 2024 09:37:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>本集节目谈论的事件皆为真实事件，但人物已经化名处理，请勿对号入座，除非你自认你就是那个懵炳……</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🕰️</span><strong><span>Timeline】</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a>吹水唔抹嘴的同事：“我们帮celine dion做过歌”</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a>乱up廿四的同事</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="609">10:09</a>Jason，你为何如此烦人（请勿对号入座）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1186">19:46</a>甲方爸爸，你为何如此压榨</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a>上司，你为何不维护自己的下属</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a>合作中套近乎占便宜的人</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">27:05</a>男性在职场中该有的风度</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1809">30:09</a>新来新猪肉就要被人“任点”？</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a>吃夹棍？吃我几棍！！！</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a>既没能力，又不勤力的同事</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a>脑袋空空，讲极唔通的同事</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a>人前人后两幅面孔的同事</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2630">43:50</a>会不会你也是别人眼中的懵炳</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">48:40</a>“小可爱”同事</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3335">55:35</a>一丢丢职场建议</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>💡</span><strong><span>Highlight】</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>1、 你身边总会有一些上司，或者上上司，会给提出一些匪夷所思的要求</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2、这要我们有共同的敌人，我们就是最好的战友</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>3、小人就像羊驼，不会像雄狮猛兽咬伤你，但就是要吐个口水恶心你</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>4、就算讨厌你的上司同事，也请不要随便吐槽（除非你用化名</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>5、可恨之人必有可爱之处</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>6、对于小人请敬而远之</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎵</span><strong><span>本期歌单】</span></strong></p><p><span>许冠杰《半斤八两》</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>📣</span><strong><span>音频平台】</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>小宇宙《荷兰郊野》</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>APPLE PODCAST《荷兰郊野》</span></strong></p><p><span>喜马拉雅《荷兰郊野》</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>📮</span><strong><span>投稿合作】</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>hollandsofunny@163.com</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p>]]></description>
