  <item>
    <title>EP03.无啦啦多个娃～重启人生之你还会不会再生B？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6686683cae8e21859a7e7b0c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6686683cae8e21859a7e7b0c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jul 2024 09:15:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>如果你能一键重启自己的人生，在知道现世发生的事情，并且拥有一切你目前为止的体验的前提下，想问你一个严肃的问题：你会不会生BB？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>为什么不想/想要BB？有BB和没有BB的人生有什么不同？有BB就能够养儿防老？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>这一集，已经生了娃的Untie Kay、卡姐、Cat都有不同的选择，而Jill则依然选择不生～来听听我们自己的体验，有共鸣记得评论区讨论讨论啊！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🕰️</span><strong><span>Timeline】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="97">01:37</a> </span><strong><span>生了BB之后，人生就进入到一个Hard模式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> </span><strong><span>生BB是你计划中的事吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="515">08:35</a> </span><strong><span>平素“不喜欢”小朋友，不等于就不会生BB</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="797">13:17</a> </span><strong><span>“你是姐姐，你要照顾好弟弟啊”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="995">16:35</a> </span><strong><span>如果可以重启人生一次，你还会选择生BB吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> </span><strong><span>被阿Cat成功劝退生B</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1325">22:05</a> </span><strong><span>看到自己BB小时候的可爱样子，突然想生二胎</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> </span><strong><span>没有无痛，只能硬生生生娃</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> </span><strong><span>大脑让你好了伤疤忘了痛，再生无忧</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2068">34:28</a> </span><strong><span>做人父母之后会精神分裂？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a> </span><strong><span>及时满足孩子，让他有足够的安全感</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2410">40:10</a> </span><strong><span>育儿育己</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a> </span><strong><span>养儿到底防不防老？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> </span><strong><span>谁不啃老？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>💡</span><strong><span>Highlight】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1、这个世界是存在平行宇宙的，生了BB的是一个宇宙，未生BB的是另一个宇宙</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2、优秀的“种子”，不容易找</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>3、对小朋友的喜爱分等级，自己生的最爱，朋友的孩子次之</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>4、有时候“不喜欢”小朋友，其实是不懂得怎么跟他们相处</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>5、相处久了，总会有觉得另一半面目可憎的时候</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>6、没有应该结婚的年纪，只有应该结婚的时机</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>7、无论是否一个有责任心的人，有事情难免总会第一时间想到自己的娃</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>8、生B，其实是思考自己有否一个强大的决心与韧性背起这个责任</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>9、生了BB之后，人生就进入到一个Hard模式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>10、孩子发疯，自己处理怒气第一招：冷静下来</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>11、一定岁数之前的娃儿总会坚定地、毫无疑问地选择爱你</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>12、应付孩子的好方法——花钱买自由</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>13、伴侣就像糯米鸡，“整定噶”！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>14、延迟满足孩子，但是及时满足自己！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>15、生还是不生，你都要为自己以后的人生做准备</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>16、养儿不防老，防晒才防老</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>17、“亲生仔不如近身钱”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>18、生不生都不影响你获得一个快乐的人生</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>🎵</span><strong><span>本期歌单】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>孙悦《祝你平安》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>📣</span><strong><span>音频平台】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小宇宙《荷兰郊野》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>APPLE PODCAST《荷兰郊野》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>📮</span><strong><span>投稿合作】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>hollandsofunny@163.com</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll56kQYS6xr_IFNbVvEvdSMV69Ps.m4a" length="114115705" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoPuTtLv1YBNxYHs76v4GmHqUIWl.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP02.婚礼居然请了华仔？那些年的离谱婚礼现场</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667a247bb6a8412729162d6f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667a247bb6a8412729162d6f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Jun 2024 03:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>婚礼请刘华，到底真定假！？</span></p><span></span><p><span>新郎选歌单，竟然有《梁祝》！？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【人生大事】系列话题之——婚礼现场的奇葩事～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【🕰️Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 主持讲错新人的名字，怎么办！？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 婚礼请了刘德华…的模仿秀演员，一生难忘！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 0530 邀请TBB演员参加婚礼的不同方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 办婚礼，不就是为了让亲友们嗨森嗨森～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> &nbsp;婚礼餐桌上的「四大金刚」的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 婚礼上的奇葩歌单，吓坏亲友～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a> 关于婚宴酒楼的奇葩事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 新兴职业：婚礼管家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 这些主人家的特别要求，你听过未？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1486">24:46</a> 这一届的年轻人，不流行结婚了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1715">28:35</a> 壕：飞到内蒙古以大自然为背景的婚礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">31:10</a> &nbsp;停下来，请庆祝这位女士回归单身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">31:55</a> &nbsp;真人真事，大妗姐接新娘现场派M巾！？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a> &nbsp;定制的可变装婚纱，当天竟忙到没时间展示！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2412">40:12</a> 新郎新娘发台瘟：讲不出话或者乱说话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a> 令人讨厌的婚礼主持行为：不断叫观众鼓掌</span></p><span></span><p><span>【💡Highlight】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、婚礼不过就是一场秀</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、婚礼现场搞这么漂亮花这么多钱，最终目的就是为了发朋友圈</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、办离婚证比办结婚证其实更贵，因为可能要请律师</span></p><span></span><p><span>【🎵本期歌单】</span></p><span></span><p><span>王力宏《forever love》</span></p><span></span><p><span>刘德华《倒转地球》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【📣音频平台】</span></p><span></span><p><span>（逐步更新）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【📮投稿合作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>hollandsofunny@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
